==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{term/t|sla-pro|*govoriti}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ru}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*gow(H)-||to call, cry}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Ru-говорить.ogg|Audio|lang=ru}}
* {{IPA|[ɡəvʌˈrʲitʲ]|lang=ru}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|говори́ть|impf|pf=сказа́ть}}

# to [[speak]], to [[talk]]
#: Я '''говорю́''' по-ру́сски - I speak Russian
# to [[say]], to [[tell]]
#: Что (''read:'' što) она́ '''говори́т'''? - What is she saying?

